  message: "FIXED in GitHub PR #12 (dev 15bc19cc7a), bundled with WI-fonod on the same finalize surface. The single masked 'tree-sitter-language-pack' entry is expanded to distinct 'tree-sitter-language-pack:<lang>' entries for the pack languages actually used, keyed off the toolchain's grammar_module='language_pack:<lang>'. They share the pack dist version (the pack exposes no per-grammar version — verified: tree_sitter_language_pack 0.13.0 has SupportedLanguage but no per-grammar version table). Verified by test_prune_grammars_to_used_covers_every_branch (nim -> tree-sitter-language-pack:nim). Spec §reproducibility_context + example updated."  # 264c
